1-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","t":["SWS_DM_00834"]},{"c":0.95,"r":"Spezifikations-Zitat SWS_DM_00832 im Belegtext.","rel":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","rls":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","t":["SWS_DM_00832"]}]},{"also":[{"c":0.95,"r":"Spezifikations-Zitat SWS_DM_00449 im Belegtext.","rel":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","rls":["R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","t":["SWS_DM_00449"]},{"c":0.95,"r":"Spezifikations-Zitat SWS_DM_00815 im Belegtext.","rel":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","rls":["R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","t":["SWS_DM_00815"]},{"c":0.95,"r":"Spezifikations-Zitat SWS_DM_00816 im Belegtext.","rel":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","rls":["R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","t":["SWS_DM_00816"]},{"c":0.95,"r":"Spezifikations-Zitat SWS_DM_01527 im Belegtext.","rel":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","rls":["R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","t":["SWS_DM_01527"]},{"c":0.9,"m":"cached_context_sweep/agy","mod":"gemini-3.8-flash","r":"Upstream requirement for GID provision","role":"heuristic","t":["RS_Diag_00026"]},{"c":0.9,"m":"cached_context_sweep/agy","mod":"gemini-3.8-flash","r":"Upstream requirement for vehicle announcement","role":"heuristic","t":["RS_Diag_04242"]}],"id":"SNIP_diag_AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_D_P106_140","text":"Specification of Diagnostics AUTOSAR AP R25-11 [SWS_DM_01527] ara::diag::DoIPGroupIdentification not yet offered when DM needs to retrieve GID Upstream requirements: RS_Diag_00026 ⌈ If the DM shall send the GID while the Offer function of the ara::diag::DoIP- GroupIdentification interface was not called yet by the Adaptive Application that provides it, the DM shall send a GID value equal to 0x00 0x00 0x00 0x00 0x00 0x00 or 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF (\"value not set\"), as defined in Table 5 and Table 1 in the ISO 13400-2[2] specification. ⌋ [SWS_DM_00815] Triggering vehicle announcement messages Upstream requirements: RS_Diag_04242 ⌈ If ara::diag::DoIPTriggerVehicleAnnouncement::TriggerVehicleAn- nouncement is called, the DM shall trigger vehicle announcement messages accord- ing to ISO 13400-2[2] on the interface identified via networkInterfaceId . ⌋ [SWS_DM_00816] Notification of activation line status change on activation line controlled network interfaces Upstream requirements: RS_Diag_04242 ⌈ If the DM detects an activation line change to active via the interface ara::diag:: DoIPActivationLine , the DM shall send the vehicle announcement messages ac- cording to ISO 13400-2[2]. ⌋ The DM needs to instantiate a singleton of ara::diag::DoIPTriggerVehi- cleAnnouncement only. The ara::diag::DoIPTriggerVehicleAnnounce- ment::TriggerVehicleAnnouncement method gets the according network- InterfaceId passed, to which the DoIP Vehicle Announcement Message (see [SWS_DM_00449]) shall be sent. Different AAs monitoring the DoIP Activation Line will inform the DM about an Activation Line toggle on its monitoring networkInter- faceId ."},{"also":[{"c":0.95,"m":"cached_context_sweep/agy","mod":"gemini-3.8-flash","r":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE (deterministic citation)","role":"constitutive","t":["RS_Diag_00026"]},{"c":0.95,"r":"Spezifikations-Zitat SWS_DM_00830 im Belegtext.","rel":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","rls":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","t":["SWS_DM_00830"]},{"c":0.95,"r":"Spezifikations-Zitat SWS_DM_00855 im Belegtext.","rel":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","rls":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","t":["SWS_DM_00855"]},{"c":0.95,"r":"Spezifikations-Zitat SWS_DM_01361 im Belegtext.","rel":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","rls":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","t":["SWS_DM_01361"]},{"c":0.95,"r":"Spezifikations-Zitat SWS_DM_01528 im Belegtext.","rel":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","rls":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","t":["SWS_DM_01528"]},{"c":0.95,"r":"Spezifikations-Zitat SWS_DM_02005 im Belegtext.","rel":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","rls":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","t":["SWS_DM_02005"]}],"id":"SNIP_diag_AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_D_P107_142","text":"AA may indirectly command the \"Vehicle Announcement Message\", using the \"Diag- nosticDoIPActivationLineInterface\" [SWS_DM_00830], but not explicit . [SWS_DM_02005] Providing VIN if interface is not available Upstream requirements: RS_Diag_00026 ⌈ If DM fails to retrieve VIN according to [SWS_DM_00855], then DM shall return VIN with value as ’0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF’ ⌋ [SWS_DM_01361] Providing EID in DoIP protocol messages using Application Interface Upstream requirements: RS_Diag_00026 ⌈ If DoIpNetworkConfiguration.eidRetrieval is configured with DoIpEi- dRetrievalEnum.eidUseApi , DM shall obtain EID by calling the method ara:: diag::DoIPEntityIdentification::GetEntityId . ⌋ [SWS_DM_01528] ara::diag::DoIPEntityIdentification not yet offered when DM needs to retrieve EID from Application Upstream requirements: RS_Diag_00026 ⌈ If DM fails to retrieve EID according to [SWS_DM_01361], DM shall send 6-byte EID value equal ’0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF 0xFF’. ⌋ [SWS_DM_02006] Providing EID using manually configured value Upstream requirements: RS_Diag_00026 ⌈ If DoIpNetworkConfiguration.eidRetrieval is configured with DoIpEi- dRetrievalEnum.eidUseConfigValue , DM shall obtain the EID as configured in DoIpFunctionalClusterDesign.eid . ⌋ [SWS_DM_02007] Providing EID using MAC of network interface Upstream requirements: RS_Diag_00026 ⌈ If DoIpNetworkConfiguration.eidRetrieval is configured with DoIpEi- dRetrievalEnum.eidUseMac , DM shall obtain the EID by reading the MAC of net- work interface. ⌋ 107 of 1171 Document ID 723: AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Diagnostics"},{"also":[{"c":0.95,"r":"Spezifikations-Zitat SWS_DM_00830 im Belegtext.","rel":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","rls":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"role":"constitutive","t":["SWS_DM_00830"]}],"id":"SNIP_diag_AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_D_P315_388"}],"v":1}
